  "steps": [
    "Brown. Heat a pan over medium-high heat and cook the mince, breaking it up, until browned.",
    "Sauce. Add soy sauce, sugar, sesame oil, vinegar, ginger, garlic and gochujang. Simmer 3–5 minutes until glossy and slightly sticky.",
    "Prep. Preheat the oven to 180 °C and line a tray with baking paper.",
    "Tortillas. Dip the tortillas lightly in water if stiff, then cut each in half.",
    "Fill. Spoon beef into the centre of each half, top with mozzarella and fold into triangles.",
    "Bake. Sprinkle with extra mozzarella and bake 20–25 minutes until deeply golden and crisp. Finish with spring onion and chilli oil."
  ],
